#: dragonpilot/dashy/serverd.py
msgid "Show distance, speed, and TTC for the lead vehicle at the bottom of the HUD."
msgstr "在 HUD 底部顯示前車距離、速度與預估碰撞時間（TTC）。"

#: dragonpilot/settings/openpilot.toggles.py
msgid "Standard"
msgstr "標準"

#: dragonpilot/settings/openpilot.toggles.py
msgid "Standard is recommended. In aggressive mode, openpilot will follow lead cars closer and be more aggressive with the gas and brake. In relaxed mode openpilot will stay further away from lead cars. On supported cars, you can cycle through these personalities with your steering wheel distance button."
msgstr "建議使用「標準」。在「積極」模式下，openpilot 會縮短跟車距離，並更積極地加速與煞車；在「舒適」模式下，跟車距離會較遠。支援的車輛可用方向盤上的車距按鈕切換駕駛風格。"

#: dragonpilot/settings/min-feat.dev.alert-mode.py
#: dragonpilot/settings/min-feat.ui.display-mode.py
msgid "Std."
msgstr "標準"

#: dragonpilot/settings/min-feat.ui.display-mode.py
msgid "Std.: Stock behavior.<br>MAIN+: ACC MAIN on = Display ON.<br>OP+: OP enabled = Display ON.<br>MAIN-: ACC MAIN on = Display OFF<br>OP-: OP enabled = Display OFF."
msgstr "標準：原廠行為。<br>MAIN+：ACC MAIN 開啟 = 螢幕開啟。<br>OP+：OP 啟用 = 螢幕開啟。<br>MAIN-：ACC MAIN 開啟 = 螢幕關閉。<br>OP-：OP 啟用 = 螢幕關閉。"

#: dragonpilot/settings/min-feat.dev.alert-mode.py
msgid "Std.: Stock behaviour.<br>Warning: Only emits sound when there is a warning.<br>Off: Does not emit any sound at all."
msgstr "標準：原廠行為。<br>警告：僅在有警告時發出聲音。<br>關閉：完全不發出聲音。"

#: dragonpilot/settings/openpilot.developer.py
msgid "Stored SSH Keys"
msgstr "已儲存的 SSH 金鑰"

#: dragonpilot/dashy/serverd.py
msgid "Temporarily go offroad to update system."
msgstr "暫時停用駕駛模式，以便更新系統。"

#: dragonpilot/dashy/serverd.py
msgid "This will reboot the device to apply changes."
