msgid "This will temporarily disable driving mode. You can update the system while offroad."
msgstr "這會暫時停用駕駛模式；進入停用狀態後即可更新系統。"

#: dragonpilot/settings/min-feat.ui.hide-hud.py
msgid "To prevent screen burn-in, hide Speed, MAX Speed, and Steering/DM Icons when the car moves.<br>Off = Stock Behavior<br>1 km/h = 0.6 mph"
msgstr "為防止螢幕烙印，在車輛行駛時隱藏速度、最高速度和轉向/DM 圖示。<br>關閉 = 原廠行為<br>1 公里/時 = 0.6 英里/時"

